  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The novel treats ice path as a named cultivation path with transformation Gu, Immortal Gu, and a twin link to snow path, not as a generic word for cold.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Bai Ning Bing names Frost demon Gu, Wei Yang frames the choice as going on the strength path and ice path, and states that for ice path the advantage lies in defense. Frost demon Gu, snow fairy Gu, and ice crystal Gu are the three most famous transformation type Gu on that line: frost demon Gu and snow fairy Gu for women, ice crystal Gu more suited for men. Bai Ning Bing then chooses ice crystal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        275
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "gu_frost_demon_gu",
        "char_wei_yang",
        "gu_snow_fairy_gu",
        "gu_ice_crystal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A normal ice path Gu Master pursues defensive or trapping abilities,",
      "chapters": [
        275
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "unlike fire path or thunder path Gu Masters who focus on explosive strength. Bai Ning Bing goes the opposite way by leaning on ice explosion Gu and related ice Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        299
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "gu_ice_explosion_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During northern plains’ ten-year blizzard, large numbers of wild snow path, ice path, and water path Gu worms start to live on snowmen’s bodies.",
      "chapters": [
        587
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A huge piece of profound ice beached on Central Continent’s east coast centuries earlier, overflowing with frost energy and gathering ice path wild Gu. The island is a poor resource site overall, yet its lasting frost energy makes it a place ice path cultivators can stay; the tropical east coast otherwise makes ice path cultivation hard to support. A contest there offers five rank three ice path Gu worm recipes as the first-place reward.",
      "chapters": [
        831
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "profound-ice-island",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "sys_wild_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Bai Sheng lends Xue Song Zi the rank six ice path Immortal Gu ice heart, an icy heart-shaped statue that emits frost energy, plus immortal killer moves using it as core for attack, defense, movement, healing, and more. Xue Song Zi was originally a snow path Gu Immortal, but snow path and ice path are twins, almost indistinguishable and closely related, so this ice path Immortal Gu and its killer moves suit him well. Qin Bai Sheng promises the ice path Immortal Gu as reward if the mission succeeds.",
      "chapters": [
        874
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ice-and-snow-twin-paths",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "char_xue_song_zi",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With perceivable dao Immortal Gu, Fang Yuan counts snow path and ice path dao marks as the greatest number in his body, reaching a total of sixteen thousand. That density would amplify an ice or snow path Immortal Gu many times over while leaving green grape immortal essence expenditure unchanged.",
      "chapters": [
        1161
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ice-path-dao-marks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_perceivable_dao_immortal_gu",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ice path crystal essence is a rare rank eight immortal material from the secluded domain Hu. Fang Yuan receives it among snowman tribe gifts and plans a snow monster production line from it.",
      "chapters": [
        1468
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "snowman-tribe-gift",
